 ## How it works
-**Inputs:** A watertight 3D mesh; a voxel grid resolution $(W, H, D)$; a camera view direction aligned with the voxelization axis (typically Z).
-**Outputs:** A 3D texture or texture array representing the solid voxel grid, where each voxel is a single bit (0 for exterior, 1 for interior).
